vLLM general plugin k31lora for the ROCm Kimi-K3.1 model (vLLM f5926fb), used by both arms: LoRA support for the
dense modules and routed experts (--enable-moe-shared-loras layout); under VLLM_BATCH_INVARIANT=1 batch-invariant dense
GEMMs, LoRA added in FP32 (K31_BI_LORA_F32ADD=1), batch-invariant MXFP4 MoE with expert LoRA (K31_BI_MOE=1,
k31lora.bi_moe, also called by the trainer) and pinned AttnRes tiling. Creates kimi-k31/k31lora/ under /opt/k31-plugins.
Upstream status: not yet proposed.

